  "original_lyrics": "[verse]\n{Intro}\n{Verse}\nWhat does it take to be.... man?\nWhat does it take to see\nIts all heart and soul gentle hand?\nSo easy to want and so hard to give\nHow can you be man\ntill you see beyond the life you live?\nOh, what does it take to be man?\n{Interlude}\n{Verse}\nWe can be blind, but man tries to see\nIt takes tenderness\nFor man to be what he can be\nAnd what does it mean\nIf youre weak or strong?\ngentle feelin\n\n[chorus]\nWhat does it take to be man?\n{Chorus}\nThe will to give and not receive\nThe strength to say what you believe\nThe heart to feel what others feel inside\nTo see what they can see\n{Solo}\n{Final}\nman is something thats real\nIts not what you are\nIts what you can feel.....\nIt cant be too late\nTo look through the hate and see....\nI know thats what man can be..\noh...........",
